{"event_id": "event_wenjie_001", "step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement", "comment_count": 20, "fallback_count": 0, "comments": [{"comment_id": "comment_061", "text": "官方说不是正式售价，但销售人员透露的参考价就够离谱了。这价格都能买辆不错的二手真车了，华为和赛力斯是不是觉得家长的钱好赚？", "profile_id": 1, "profile_label": "愤世嫉俗的批判者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_062", "text": "理性分析一下，儿童电动车定价高可能包含品牌溢价、技术授权和营销成本。但15800元确实远超市场同类产品，除非有独特功能或限量属性，否则难以支撑。建议等官方正式发布再评价。", "profile_id": 2, "profile_label": "理性客观的分析师", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "fact", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_063", "text": "看到这个价格，想到我小时候只能玩几十块的玩具车，现在的孩子真幸福。但15800元对普通家庭来说太贵了，希望官方能出个亲民版，让更多孩子体验科技带来的快乐。", "profile_id": 3, "profile_label": "共情共鸣的叙事者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_064", "text": "15800？这价格是给儿童车镶金边了吗？还是说买这车送华为手机？不然我实在想不通为什么这么贵，难道是智商税？", "profile_id": 4, "profile_label": "玩世不恭的段子手", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "吃瓜派", "orientation": "questioning", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_065", "text": "作为家长，我觉得给孩子买这么贵的玩具车，容易助长攀比心理。孩子需要的是陪伴和正确的价值观，而不是用金钱堆砌的虚荣。希望家长们理性消费。", "profile_id": 5, "profile_label": "道德捍卫的审判官", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_066", "text": "我本来想给孩子买一辆问界儿童车，看到这个价格直接劝退。虽然喜欢华为和赛力斯，但15800元确实超出预算，希望官方能给出合理的定价，别让普通家庭望而却步。", "profile_id": 6, "profile_label": "利益相关的受害者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_067", "text": "科普一下：儿童电动车通常价格在几百到几千元，高端品牌如法拉利、兰博基尼的授权儿童车也不过万元左右。15800元确实偏高，但如果是限量版或具备智能驾驶功能，或许有溢价空间。", "profile_id": 7, "profile_label": "博闻强识的科普君", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "fact", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_068", "text": "前排吃瓜，坐等官方打脸。这价格一出，估计又是一波热搜，不知道会不会有土豪买来给孩子玩，反正我看看就好。", "profile_id": 8, "profile_label": "吃瓜不嫌事大的围观者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "吃瓜派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_069", "text": "从社会角度看，高端儿童玩具的定价反映了消费升级和品牌溢价现象。但过高的价格可能加剧社会阶层分化，让普通家庭的孩子产生心理落差。企业应承担更多社会责任，避免过度商业化。", "profile_id": 9, "profile_label": "忧国忧民的沉思者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_070", "text": "华为和赛力斯联合设计的产品，品质肯定有保障。虽然价格不菲，但这是中国品牌的高端尝试，我们应该支持。相信官方会给出合理的定价，期待正式发布。", "profile_id": 10, "profile_label": "朴素爱国拥趸", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "positive", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "support", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_071", "text": "官方说不是正式售价，但销售人员透露的参考价就能随便说？这难道不是变相营销吗？", "profile_id": 1, "profile_label": "愤世嫉俗的批判者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "questioning", "stance": "questioning", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_072", "text": "从成本角度看，儿童车用料、设计、品牌溢价都可能推高价格，但15800元确实偏高，建议等官方公布配置再判断。", "profile_id": 2, "profile_label": "理性客观的分析师", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "fact", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_073", "text": "看到这个价格，想起小时候只能玩几十块的玩具车，现在的孩子真幸福，但家长压力也大啊。", "profile_id": 3, "profile_label": "共情共鸣的叙事者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_074", "text": "15800？不如买辆二手奥拓，还能上牌，儿童车再豪华也不能上路啊，哈哈。", "profile_id": 4, "profile_label": "玩世不恭的段子手", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "positive", "faction": "吃瓜派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_075", "text": "给孩子买这么贵的车，是炫富还是真爱？价值观扭曲，应该引导孩子正确消费观。", "profile_id": 5, "profile_label": "道德捍卫的审判官", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_076", "text": "作为家长，我本来想给孩子买一辆，但15800元太贵了，如果真是这个价，我只能放弃。", "profile_id": 6, "profile_label": "利益相关的受害者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_077", "text": "儿童电动车市场一般价格在几百到几千，15800元确实罕见，但问界M9本身售价就高，复刻版可能用料讲究，具体看配置。", "profile_id": 7, "profile_label": "博闻强识的科普君", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "fact", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_078", "text": "前排吃瓜，坐等官方打脸，这价格是认真的吗？", "profile_id": 8, "profile_label": "吃瓜不嫌事大的围观者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "positive", "faction": "吃瓜派", "orientation": "questioning", "stance": "questioning", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_079", "text": "高端儿童车定价反映社会消费分层，可能加剧攀比心理，值得深思。", "profile_id": 9, "profile_label": "忧国忧民的沉思者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_080", "text": "华为和赛力斯联合设计，品质有保障，价格高一点也合理，支持国货！", "profile_id": 10, "profile_label": "朴素爱国拥趸", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "positive", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "support", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}]}
