: "neutral", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_094", "text": "华为和赛力斯联合设计，品质应该有保障，但价格确实不菲，希望物有所值。", "profile_id": 10, "profile_label": "朴素爱国拥趸", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "positive", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "support", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_095", "text": "这价格都够买辆二手QQ了，儿童车比真车还贵，真是魔幻现实主义。", "profile_id": 1, "profile_label": "愤世嫉俗的批判者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "情绪激进派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_096", "text": "官方声明说后续会发布正式售价，大家稍安勿躁，理性看待。", "profile_id": 2, "profile_label": "理性客观的分析师", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "fact", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_097", "text": "想起小时候骑的竹马，现在孩子都开上豪车了，时代变了。", "profile_id": 3, "profile_label": "共情共鸣的叙事者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "吃瓜派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_098", "text": "这种高价儿童车会不会助长攀比风气？对孩子成长不利。", "profile_id": 5, "profile_label": "道德捍卫的审判官", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_099", "text": "儿童车市场定位高端，但也要考虑实际价值，希望官方定价合理，不要辜负消费者信任。", "profile_id": 9, "profile_label": "忧国忧民的沉思者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_100", "text": "问界M9儿童版，1:1复刻，这波操作666，就是价格有点感人。", "profile_id": 4, "profile_label": "玩世不恭的段子手", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "吃